Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.89,0:00:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.91,0:00:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.29,0:00:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.47,0:00:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.25,0:00:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.85,0:00:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.69,0:00:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.39,0:00:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Confess left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.61,0:00:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.57,0:01:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place that\Nthe end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.01,0:01:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary till\Nsomeone proves it real?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.23,0:01:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through\Nall the trouble of times!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.51,0:01:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.87,0:01:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be\Nthere and stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.21,0:01:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.29,0:01:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.41,0:01:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.95,0:01:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.13,0:01:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.75,0:01:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.11,0:01:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.07,0:01:57.70,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(561,1022)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(519,561,\1a&H00&)\t(6608,6650,\1a&HFF&)}The Silent Man
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.07,0:01:57.70,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(561,1022)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}The Silent Man
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.89,0:02:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rotten woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.97,0:02:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you try to make a fool\Nof the great Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.31,0:02:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Insulting me for having\Nthe blood of a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.49,0:02:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, you don't have to do this, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.83,0:02:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Klahadore?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.11,0:02:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Klahadore, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.03,0:02:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Klahadore?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.11,0:02:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.43,0:02:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.25,0:02:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.16,0:02:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.08,0:02:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.99,0:02:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please wake up! Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.93,0:02:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.31,0:02:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.09,0:03:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.33,0:03:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.15,0:03:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to tell me who did this to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.67,0:03:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Klahadore! That's who!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.83,0:03:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He attacked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.87,0:03:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.79,0:03:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.43,0:03:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's never been anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.75,0:03:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.53,0:03:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got close to you just so\Nhe could steal your fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.67,0:03:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all he ever wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.71,0:03:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what Usopp spoke about\Nyesterday was the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.05,0:03:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.09,0:03:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's what is most tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.23,0:03:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he learned the truth, he tried\Nhis hardest to get us to hear him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.13,0:04:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we were all too shallow-minded,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.39,0:04:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too confident in the\Nclosed-off world we've
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.75,0:04:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lived in for so long to\Nlisten to a single word.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.59,0:04:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick! Run, Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.29,0:04:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.27,0:04:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise this will all\Nmake sense tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.87,0:04:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In our blind protection of\Nthe villain in our midst,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.29,0:04:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we drove away the one brave\Nlad whose desperate resolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.07,0:04:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he enacted for the sake and safety\Nof every person of this village?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.57,0:04:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,including you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.79,0:04:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.43,0:04:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary needs help! No, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.93,0:04:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's of no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.23,0:04:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire staff is on leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.17,0:04:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one has been here since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.43,0:04:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.26,0:04:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cannot let yourself\Nget flustered, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.53,0:04:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know the attack has yet to begin,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.99,0:04:56.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so be calm and think clearly about\Nwhat it is you have to do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.75,0:05:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if Klahadore is the\Nthief we understand him to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.17,0:05:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and his goal is your fortune and your\Nmansion, then by all means let him have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.67,0:05:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of this is worth\Nsacrificing your life over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.19,0:05:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.29,0:05:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a cruel truth, but you are the\Nonly one who can stop Crocodile now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.27,0:05:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.69,0:05:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this is not your\Nburden, but still I must ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.95,0:05:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand, and I will do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.87,0:05:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't a situation\NI can run away from.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.69,0:05:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what consequences I face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.79,0:05:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will find Kaido and I will finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.73,0:05:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.71,0:05:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw Clawador heading to the shore?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.41,0:05:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and he had this weird,\Nscary look on his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.09,0:05:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Carrot, would you wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's way too early for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.73,0:05:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no time for laziness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.65,0:06:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horrible things could\Nbe happening right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.83,0:06:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still think the pirates\Nare going to attack soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.69,0:06:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know our captain said that was a lie,\Nbut I think he was the one that was lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.33,0:06:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're probably right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.71,0:06:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seemed off yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.99,0:06:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain wasn't his usual self.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.85,0:06:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.83,0:06:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.25,0:06:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like something's\Ngot her really bothered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.03,0:06:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, walking around outside\Nby herself doesn't seem right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.61,0:06:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.43,0:06:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something really weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.87,0:06:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come forth, Brook!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.16,0:06:53.16,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an8\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(436,478,\1a&H00&)}{Sham\NShip Guard - Funi}Sham\NShip Guard\NBlack Cat Pirates{Polly}
Dialogue: 2,0:06:50.16,0:06:53.16,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an8\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\3c&HFAFAFB&\c&HFAFAFB&\1a&HFF&\t(436,478,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}{Sham\NShip Guard - Funi}Sham\NShip Guard\NBlack Cat Pirates{Polly}
Dialogue: 3,0:06:50.16,0:06:53.16,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&HFAFAFB&\4a&HFF&}{Sham\NShip Guard - Funi}Sham\NShip Guard\NBlack Cat Pirates{Polly}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.57,0:06:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.81,0:06:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you call for us?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.33,0:06:56.46,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(436,478,\1a&H00&)}{Buchi\NShip Guard - Funi}Buchi\NShip Guard\NBlack Cat Pirates{Polly}
Dialogue: 2,0:06:53.33,0:06:56.46,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(436,478,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}{Buchi\NShip Guard - Funi}Buchi\NShip Guard\NBlack Cat Pirates{Polly}
Dialogue: 3,0:06:53.33,0:06:56.46,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}{Buchi\NShip Guard - Funi}Buchi\NShip Guard\NBlack Cat Pirates{Polly}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.93,0:06:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.09,0:06:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xiong! And Bucci!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.15,0:07:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we are the Meowban brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At your service!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.03,0:07:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bucci,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.94,0:07:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xiong, we absolutely\Nmust get up this hill,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.57,0:07:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but as you can plainly\Nsee, our path is blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.63,0:07:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if he would be so kind as to\Nremove this obstacle immediately?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.59,0:07:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.11,0:07:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We couldn't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.33,0:07:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Bucci?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, he's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.73,0:07:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way stronger than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.31,0:07:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.87,0:07:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, we just guard the\Nship, not fight people!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.07,0:07:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.25,0:07:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're really not the guys\Nyou want to send into battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.21,0:07:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, they're a couple of pansies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.27,0:07:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess they're not the\Ntrump card after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.83,0:07:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xiong, just do it already! Ah!\NWhat? Please, not me! And hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.69,0:07:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll go. Just stop yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy's crying like a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.21,0:07:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they doing down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.33,0:07:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all people, why force\Nthat guy into a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.27,0:07:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna tear you off with these claws!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.53,0:07:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.81,0:07:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a vicious killing machine,\Nand I'm coming for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.63,0:07:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bad people!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.83,0:08:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You come any closer, and\NI'll cut you in half!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.93,0:08:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.27,0:08:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.17,0:08:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impressed? Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.81,0:08:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems you fell for my little ruse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.71,0:08:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you blocked me, considering\Nwhat a brilliant performance I gave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.77,0:08:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let the teeny bit\Nof skill you have cause
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.35,0:08:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you to underestimate Siam\Nof the Meowban Brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.49,0:08:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you missing something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.19,0:08:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that I would know anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.51,0:08:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.57,0:08:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cat burglar give me my swords back your\Nswords, but you already have a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.07,0:08:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How greedy can you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.71,0:08:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.41,0:08:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.33,0:09:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I feel lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.63,0:09:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really have to be faster,\Nbecause I'm agile as a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.81,0:09:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beach, you're up. Get in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.29,0:09:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She makes you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.83,0:09:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Faster, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.89,0:09:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, Beach!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.19,0:09:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got away from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.83,0:09:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he's right there, and\NI'll hold him tight this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.45,0:09:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful, he's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.87,0:09:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stronger than I thought he'd\Nbe, even without all his blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.95,0:09:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is getting worse by the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.67,0:09:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Tummy there would have landed on me,\NI'd have been pounded into the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.45,0:09:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get him for sure this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.23,0:09:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got that right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.65,0:10:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One sword technique's not my\Nforte, fellas, but what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.91,0:10:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.21,0:10:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Siam, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.57,0:10:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pussy Willow March!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.83,0:10:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.21,0:10:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got him on the defensive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.65,0:10:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Usam?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way that\NZoro can gain any ground
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.49,0:10:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if he's too busy blocking their attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.47,0:10:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.87,0:10:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.01,0:10:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.01,0:10:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.07,0:10:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to shoot\Nat the bad guys, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.95,0:10:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.21,0:10:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.15,0:10:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was like he moved in\Nfront of my shot on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.91,0:10:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.79,0:11:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dumbass! Don't help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.93,0:11:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.29,0:11:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a thought, but maybe it's\Nthe two of us who just got saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.15,0:11:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had actually hit one of those guys,\Nthey would have come after us instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.19,0:11:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we wouldn't have had a\Nchance of holding up against that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.73,0:11:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.64,0:11:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this time, he was worried about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I just had one more sword,\NI could take these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.95,0:11:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get the swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.41,0:11:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can get them back to Zoro,\Nthere'll be no way he can lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.01,0:11:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me get the swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.41,0:11:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.79,0:11:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can barely even stand up on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.47,0:11:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:11:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.17,0:12:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you need swords for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.31,0:12:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.22,0:12:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can explain all of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.15,0:12:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The night has long since passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.41,0:12:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why is it that you seem to have made\Nno progress on the plan? Captain! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.83,0:12:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.65,0:12:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.75,0:13:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think that these\Nbrats have held you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.41,0:13:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the black cat pirates have fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.17,0:13:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you got to say for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.11,0:13:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jungle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.55,0:13:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, uh, well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.89,0:13:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir, but you said letting the\Nkid go wouldn't cause any problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.47,0:13:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.57,0:13:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.77,0:13:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew no one would listen\Nto his warnings and he
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would come stumbling back\Nto take a stand against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.77,0:14:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the one thing I hadn't taken account\Nfor was your inexcusable weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.09,0:14:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.45,0:14:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.73,0:14:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you to call us weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.07,0:14:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would you say, Captain Kuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.21,0:14:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You used to be quite the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.87,0:14:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But face it, kuro, it's been three years!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.43,0:14:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we haven't exactly\Nbeen living the good life?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.95,0:14:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,waiting on a rich girl hand and foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.41,0:14:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.83,0:14:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For three long years, we've been out sinking\Npirate ships and massacring villages.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.11,0:14:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very good. Finished. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.89,0:14:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've done nothing this whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.79,0:14:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been killing you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.53,0:14:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Butler, there's no way you\Ncan beat the Meowban Brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.81,0:14:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't! Buggy! Xion! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.79,0:14:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,YOU ARE NOT CAPTAIN ANYMORE!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.99,0:14:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sorry, but we have to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.89,0:15:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? He's behind them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell'd he...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.77,0:15:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm one of those crazy weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.27,0:15:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you going to kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.61,0:15:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He snuck out right behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.51,0:15:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.51,0:15:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Pussyfoot Maneuver!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.89,0:15:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.17,0:15:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do feel a bit sluggish\Nafter all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.37,0:15:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's handling them like\Nbabies and those two
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.83,0:15:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nearly defeated Zoro with\Nhis pussyfoot maneuver.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.59,0:16:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Kuro could shred everyone on this\Nbeach before we drew our next breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.29,0:16:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't even see it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.13,0:16:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no escape from a\Nkilling machine like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.99,0:16:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew he hadn't grown soft when\NI saw that old habit of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.53,0:16:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That strange way of lifting his\Nglasses so that he won't cut his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.67,0:16:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he never stopped\Nwearing those cat claws.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.55,0:16:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're almost a part of his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.39,0:16:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course he hasn't\Nforgotten how to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.09,0:16:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're very lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.25,0:16:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling somewhat merciful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.75,0:16:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe these years on dry\Nland have made me soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.97,0:16:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.69,0:16:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't deal with the\Nsituation here in five minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.21,0:16:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'll kill every last one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.19,0:16:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now have I made myself clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.03,0:17:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.27,0:17:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, that's perfectly clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.13,0:17:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for being so forgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.87,0:17:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is take\Ncare of this one guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.27,0:17:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.18,0:17:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five minutes will be more\Nthan enough time for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.49,0:17:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We nearly had him a few minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.61,0:17:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't need one minute\Nto finish him this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.11,0:17:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.97,0:17:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill him, kill him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.65,0:17:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.71,0:17:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, easy there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.27,0:17:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just kick him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.61,0:17:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are my swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.63,0:17:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a thanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.27,0:17:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.53,0:17:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.44,0:17:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.79,0:18:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.11,0:18:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't matter how many swords you have!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.99,0:18:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now you'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.91,0:18:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only three of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.03,0:18:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.51,0:18:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The clock is ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.41,0:18:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Carrying three swords won't help you at\Nall, unless you know three-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.79,0:18:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.55,0:18:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.83,0:19:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took down the Meowban\Nbrothers with one attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.35,0:19:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.47,0:19:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can promise you everything will be\Ntaken care of in less than five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.35,0:19:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.27,0:19:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three minutes left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.31,0:19:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll slaughter him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.01,0:19:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.81,0:19:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.21,0:19:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hypnotize me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.65,0:19:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just do it, captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.87,0:20:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.31,0:20:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do sloppy work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.65,0:20:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he is. I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.53,0:20:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let Blueno protect his vitals?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.97,0:20:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buggy, kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.73,0:20:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.13,0:20:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You back for more?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.21,0:20:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy knows business.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.51,0:20:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was trouble when he was half this size.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.11,0:20:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then jango had to flip his psycho switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.07,0:21:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.13,0:21:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta wake that lazy jerk up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.37,0:21:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I still can!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.35,0:21:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that girl up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.37,0:21:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something tricky, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.01,0:21:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone else is busy\Nfighting for their lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.37,0:21:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's just sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.07,0:21:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up, you bum!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.47,0:21:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.17,0:21:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was nice knowing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.07,0:21:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dodge! It, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.31,0:21:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.13,0:21:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it was just a hypnotic\Ncharm, but it's also his weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.27,0:21:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.23,0:21:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cannot just go around\Nstepping on people's eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.77,0:21:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is that twerp still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.79,0:21:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's either the best timing or\Nthe worst timing in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.55,0:21:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.65,0:22:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.59,0:22:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.19,0:22:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, that guy's back in the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.93,0:22:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.63,0:22:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five minutes will never be enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.19,0:22:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hurts, you jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.89,0:22:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.93,0:22:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, sleeping beauty, that wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.39,0:22:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.25,0:22:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.55,0:22:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, did you get hurt? Let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.69,0:22:41.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.75,0:22:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done everything I can for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.89,0:22:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.65,0:22:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, we have to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.29,0:22:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to lose this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.01,0:22:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.49,0:22:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.81,0:22:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Win this and protect my treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.43,0:23:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, the treasure. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.19,0:23:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One minute and counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.05,0:23:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karoo can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.55,0:23:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't possibly finish\Nthem in one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.31,0:23:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on guys, stop messing\Naround and end this already
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.09,0:23:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buggy! There's no time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.65,0:23:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill that three sword bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.37,0:23:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of the freaky bendable kid
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.17,0:23:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.77,0:23:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.17,0:23:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is that shady butler here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.89,0:23:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.75,0:23:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't he die falling off a cliff?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.01,0:23:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.55,0:24:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.91,0:24:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ever sneak up on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.23,0:24:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.83,0:24:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Usopp! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.55,0:24:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaya, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.33,0:24:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.55,0:24:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.19,0:24:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you'll ever forget me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.53,0:24:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.85,0:24:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Klahadore is a\Nscheming, murdering pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.21,0:24:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.49,0:24:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.33,0:24:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaya, your life is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.33,0:25:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to run somewhere safe. I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.25,0:25:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still here fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.73,0:25:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.81,0:25:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fought for me after\NI treated you so badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.05,0:25:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at you, you're barely\Nalive, but you're still so brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.29,0:25:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.63,0:25:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no place for a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.65,0:25:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam, please leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.17,0:25:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop, don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.65,0:25:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop, stop this right now, claw at door!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.51,0:25:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what you're up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.23,0:25:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary already told me about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.81,0:25:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the girl from the\Nmansion doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.45,0:25:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole reason that we're here\Nis to murder that little rich girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.99,0:25:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she's here, then we don't\Nhave to go to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.47,0:25:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we gotta do is kill her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.95,0:25:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clawador, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.19,0:26:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want my fortune, you can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.33,0:26:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it all and leave\Nthis village right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.73,0:26:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you. I will gladly\Naccept your fortune, Miss Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.83,0:26:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.51,0:26:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I want more you see simply\Nacquiring wealth isn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.61,0:26:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More than anything else!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.45,0:26:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I want is peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.49,0:26:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.69,0:26:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, just peace peace of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.97,0:26:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's simple, really. I have\Nspent the last three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.51,0:26:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,earning the trust of the entire\Nvillage and to be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.97,0:26:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find this new sense of peace\Nand tranquility quite comforting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.61,0:26:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When my plan comes to fruition, I will\Nlive with this sublime peace of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.39,0:26:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.30,0:26:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The glorious comfort of a peaceful life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.07,0:27:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will be mine for forever and ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.03,0:27:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In short, these pirates are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.07,0:27:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you will leave your\Nfortune to me and die?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.05,0:27:15.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kaya, these things will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.05,0:27:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.03,0:27:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.59,0:27:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run away, Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.13,0:27:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no use talking to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.65,0:27:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.07,0:27:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not Pahator.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.37,0:27:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.99,0:27:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.37,0:27:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave here, right now. Never come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.69,0:27:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.77,0:27:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all grown up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.37,0:27:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much has happened in\Nthe last three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.91,0:27:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.09,0:27:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember the\Nthings we went through?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.07,0:27:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We spent so much time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.85,0:27:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even before your dear\Nsweet parents passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.39,0:28:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were more than my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.53,0:28:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.85,0:28:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.99,0:28:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many memories... Together we suffered,\Ntogether we rejoiced like family.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.53,0:28:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took you on shopping trips to\Nthe city I looked after you so
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.07,0:28:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,diligently when you were ill and we\Nused to talk for hours and hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.61,0:28:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaya listen to me I was devoted to you
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.95,0:28:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for so long for so
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.79,0:28:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,very long I endured it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.07,0:28:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I quietly suffered so\Nthat today I could end
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.87,0:28:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your life and take\Neverything that I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.25,0:29:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I who was once the feared\Nand respected Captain Kuro,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.59,0:29:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had to bow and humble myself\Nbefore some snot-nosed little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.43,0:29:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It went against every fiber of my being.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.45,0:29:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.27,0:29:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you understand the depth\Nof these daily insults?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.47,0:29:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you understand the rage created by\Nthose transgressions against my pride?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.67,0:29:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for reminding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.73,0:29:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, I owe you for\Nhitting me. Let's get even.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.17,0:29:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.23,0:29:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I recall, you hit me as\Nhard as you could, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.95,0:30:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.61,0:30:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hates getting hit that much.\NHe's about to have a really bad day!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.09,0:30:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.59,0:30:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never stopped Searching\Nfor a great treasure I had
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.53,0:30:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a map in my mind That I
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.43,0:30:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knew would lead me I had to
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.71,0:30:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,find my way to that place\NBefore someone could beat me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.17,0:30:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The promised land was in my\Ngrasp And I wouldn't let go
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.85,0:31:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La, la, la,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.69,0:31:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,la My only dream La, la,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.65,0:31:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,la, la, la I won't stop\Nchasing it until it comes true!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.31,0:31:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever\Nchanges I call out your name
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.77,0:31:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can return to the time\Nwhen everything's the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.23,0:31:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.77,0:31:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my memories won't fade Waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.13,0:31:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for that one true dream?

